You don't know me. I'm a proud woman.

406
00:18:03,440 --> 00:18:04,820
我就求过两次人 另外一次是
The only other time I ever begged

407
00:18:04,820 --> 00:18:06,680
求着要离开吹牛老爹的游艇
was to get off of P. Diddy's yacht.

408
00:18:07,780 --> 00:18:09,780
因为哪有派对一开就是开三天的啊
I mean, a party shouldn't be three days long.

409
00:18:10,720 --> 00:18:12,700
小姐 你可以省省你的白痴说辞
Miss, you can save your silly breath.

410
00:18:12,860 --> 00:18:13,900
我要带他回家
I'm taking him home.

411
00:18:14,260 --> 00:18:17,600
乘客梅芙·奥布赖恩请到登机台
Would passenger Maeve O'Brien please report to the gate desk?

412
00:18:18,340 --> 00:18:20,243
纳西 或许他们把我们升舱了
Oh, Nash, maybe they're bumping us up

413
00:18:20,243 --> 00:18:23,100
从经济舱的倒数第一排升到倒数第二排
from the last coach row to the second to the last coach row!

414
00:18:23,100 --> 00:18:26,220
我就知道当初坚持不堕胎终有一天会有回报
I knew I'd be rewarded for not having any abortions

415
00:18:26,220 --> 00:18:27,800
尽管家里已经穷得揭不开锅了
