天啊 我搞了一个娃
Oh, my God, I screwed a baby.

427
00:18:59,780 --> 00:19:01,200
好了 我要发短信给乔
Okay. I'm gonna text Joe

428
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:03,360
告诉她纳西在我们手上
and tell her we have Nash in our custody.

429
00:19:03,900 --> 00:19:05,100
算了 还是打电话吧
No, I'd better call.

430
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:06,960
如果被抓 短信会成为不利证据
That text won't play well at our trial.

431
00:19:08,960 --> 00:19:11,160
抱歉我没告诉你我还小
I'm sorry I didn't tell ya I was so young.

432
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:13,460
但老实说 我觉得这不重要
But honestly, I didn't think it mattered

433
