462
00:20:22,533 --> 00:20:27,924
是啊 地点就在8号"国际"航站楼
Yeah. It's gonna be international terminal 8!

463
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:29,600
什么
What?

464
00:20:30,800 --> 00:20:31,400
这里吗
Here?

465
00:20:31,940 --> 00:20:33,440
